{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52513","headline":"应制 二 · 宗楚客","name":"应制 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仪乾开宝历，御极转金轮。\n（同前书同卷引宗楚诗）（按：《海录碎事》卷十录初唐人应制诗句，中署宗楚客作者四联，《全唐诗》卷四六收入三联，其中「七萃銮舆动，千年瑞检开」二句，爲李峤《奉和拜洛应制》之首二句，叶氏误署。\n《全唐诗》未收之「殷荐三神享，明祠万玉陪」，爲李峤同诗中句，文字略异。\n同卷另录李宗楚诗一句，当爲宗楚客之讹，今录入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗楚客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}